src/content/works/alfa-romeo-giulia/inde.2e302d460652593e:
Alfa Romeo Giulia 2021. godište je došla kod nas u Beogradu na redovni servis. Iako smo planirali samo zamenu ulja, odlučili smo se da opserviramo sve potrošne delove i pritom servisiramo i automatsku transmisiju.

Šta smo uradili:

- zamenili smo sveće;
- zamenili smo motorno ulje;
- zamenili smo uljni filter;
- zamenili smo vazdušni filter;
- zamenili smo filter kabine;
- potpuno zamenili dno automatske transmisije;
- zamenili smo ulje u automatskoj transmisiji ZF 8HP.

Posebno smo se posvetili transmisiji. Na modelima sa automatskim menjačem **ZF 8HP** stanje ulja i dna treba pažljivo pratiti i ne čekati sa servisom: pravovremeno održavana transmisija je znatno jeftinija za popravku od one koja je zapostavljena.

src/content/works/alfa-romeo-giulia/inde.dfdb8e2d62416458:
The 2021 Alfa Romeo Giulia arrived at our service in Belgrade for its routine maintenance. We didn't stop at just an oil change; we checked all consumables and serviced the automatic transmission as well.

**What We Did:**

- Replaced the spark plugs;
- Changed the engine oil;
- Replaced the oil filter;
- Swapped out the air filter;
- Changed the cabin filter;
- Completely replaced the automatic transmission pan;
- Refilled the ZF 8HP transmission fluid.

We paid special attention to the transmission. For the **ZF 8HP** automatics, it's essential to keep an eye on the oil and pan condition and not delay maintenance. A well-serviced transmission is significantly more affordable to maintain than one that has been neglected.

src/content/works/mercedes-benz-c200/ind.0c9bc49c592f04ef:
The Mercedes-Benz C-Class W205 arrived at our service center in Belgrade for a minor service.

We carried out the following tasks:

- Oil change;
- Replacement of the oil filter;
- Replacement of the engine air filter;
- Replacement of the cabin filter;
- Replacement of all brake pads;
- Inspection and maintenance of the braking system.

A note on the brakes: Brake pads are one of the key safety components, and it's essential to monitor their condition regularly. When replacing pads, we also check the **discs, calipers, and guides**: if any of these parts are corroded or worn, the vehicle will not brake evenly.

src/content/works/mercedes-benz-c200/ind.3e521338bdffaf2e:
Mercedes-Benz C-Class W205 je stigao u naš auto servis u Beogradu na malo tehničko održavanje.

Uradili smo:

- zamenu motorno ulja;
- zamenu uljnog filtera;
- zamenu filtera za vazduh u motoru;
- zamenu kabinskog filtera;
- zamenu svih kočionih pločica;
- servisiranje i proveru kočionog sistema.

Posebno o kočnicama. Pločice su jedan od ključnih elemenata sigurnosti, i treba ih redovno proveravati. Kada menjamo pločice, uvek gledamo i **diskove, čeljusti i vođice**: ako je nešto od toga zahrđalo ili istrošeno, kočenje će biti neravnomerno.

src/content/works/mini-cooper-sd/index.m.142fd6238d16126f:
MINI Cooper SD sa dizel motorom **2.0 B47 od 170 KS** dovezen je u naš auto servis u Beogradu radi kompletnog održavanja.

Urađeno je:

- zamena motornih ulja;
- zamena svih filtora;
- zamena gorivnog filtr;
- zamena ulja u 8-brzinskom automatu Aisin;
- kompjuterska dijagnostika motora i elektronskih sistema;
- dijagnostika usisnog sistema.

Gorivni filter na dizelu treba menjati najmanje jednom na **20 000 km**: tako se štiti gorivni sistem, a motor radi stabilno.

Tokom dijagnostike usisnog sistema pronašli smo značajno zagađenje: vortex lapovi su bili prekriveni čađom i naslagama, tvrdom „kožom“. Predložili smo vlasniku čišćenje, on se složio, i usis je potpuno opran.

Dizel B47 u BMW-u i MINI-ju, automatik Aisin i usisni sistem vole redovne intervale: pravovremena zamena ulja i filtera, te praćenje stanja usisa. Tada se skupi popravka odlaže na duže vreme.

src/content/works/mini-cooper-sd/index.m.66c69f22303b6ac8:
The MINI Cooper SD with a **2.0 B47 diesel engine producing 170 hp** arrived at our car service in Belgrade for comprehensive maintenance.

Here’s what we did:

- Changed the engine oil;
- Replaced all filters;
- Swapped the fuel filter;
- Changed the oil in the 8-speed Aisin automatic transmission;
- Performed a computer diagnostics on the engine and electronic systems;
- Conducted a diagnostic check of the intake system.

It is recommended to replace the fuel filter on diesel engines at least once every **20,000 km**. This keeps the fuel system protected and ensures the engine runs smoothly.

During the intake diagnostics, we discovered significant contamination: the swirl flaps were heavily caked with soot and carbon buildup, creating a dense "coat." We suggested a cleaning service to the owner, who agreed, and we thoroughly cleaned the intake.

The B47 diesel engine found in BMW and MINI, along with the Aisin transmission and intake system, thrives on regular maintenance: timely oil and filter changes, along with monitoring the intake condition. This strategy helps prevent costly repairs down the line.

src/content/works/obsluzhivanie-tormozno.9190fae371739984:
A vehicle arrived at our car service in Belgrade with a complaint of **vibration when braking**: the driver presses the pedal, and the car starts to shake.

We began with wheel balancing — this is the most common cause of such vibrations and the easiest to rule out. The balancing was fine, so we moved on to the braking system.

At first glance, the discs and pads seemed fine, showing no obvious signs of severe wear. However, upon closer inspection, we discovered that the **left brake disc was warped**. This was causing the vibration.

We informed the client and agreed on the repair. Here’s what we carried out:

- Diagnosis of the braking system;
- Checking and balancing the wheels;
- Detection of the left brake disc deformation;
- Replacement of the brake discs;
- Replacement of the brake pads;
- Re-checking the wheel balancing;
- Test drive after the repair.

The vibration during braking completely disappeared after this, and we checked the car before handing it back to the owner.

A disc may look normal but can still be warped — such deformation isn’t detectable by the naked eye. Therefore, if you notice steering wheel shake, pedal vibration, or body vibrations when braking, it's best not to postpone the diagnosis.

src/content/works/obsluzhivanie-tormozno.9bca8298d0389c27:
U naš servis u Beogradu je stiglo vozilo sa pritužbom na **vibracije prilikom kočenja**: vozač pritisne kočnicu, a auto počne da se trese.

Počeli smo od balansiranja točkova — to je najčešći uzrok takvih vibracija i najlakše ga je isključiti. Balansiranje je bilo u redu, pa smo nastavili dalje sa kočionim sistemom.

Na prvi pogled, diskovi i kočnice su izgledali dobro, bez vidljivih znakova velikog trošenja. U detaljnoj prolezi otkriveno je da je **levi kočioni disk deformisan**. On je izazivao vibracije.

P pokazali smo klijentu i dogovorili se o popravci. Šta smo uradili:

- dijagnostika kočionog sistema;
- provera i balansiranje točkova;
- otkrivanje deformacije levog kočionog diska;
- zamena kočionih diskova;
- zamena kočionih pločica;
- ponovna provera balansiranja točkova;
- kontrolna vožnja nakon popravke.

Vibracije prilikom kočenja su nakon toga potpuno nestale, vozilo je provereno i predato vlasniku.

Disk može izgledati normalno, a da pritom bude izobličen — takvu deformaciju je teško primetiti golim okom. Zato, ako primetite podrhtavanje volana, vibracije pedale ili karoserije prilikom kočenja, dijagnostiku ne treba odlagati.

src/content/works/peugeot-308-sw/index.m.3ff6169b706a6e26:
Peugeot 308 iz 2024. godine sa dizel motorom **1.5 BlueHDi** došao je kod nas u CarLab, nezavisni auto servis u Beogradu, na veliki servis. Odrađen je kompletan opseg radova:

- zamena lanca razvodnog mehanizma;
- zamena vodene pumpe;
- zamena antifriza;
- zamena motornog ulja;
- zamena filtera;
- pregled i servis svih pratećih komponenti.

Uz motor 1.5 BlueHDi postoji jedna stavka na koju bi trebalo obratiti pažnju: lanac koji pokreće bregastu osovinu. Na ranijim verzijama ovog motora bio je lanac širine **7 mm**. Tokom vremena on se isteže, a u najgorem slučaju se lomi, što može da dovede do ozbiljnih problema sa motorom.

Preporučuje se da se prilikom servisa ovakvih motora postavlja pojačani lanac **8 mm**, zajedno sa ležajem bregaste osovine i samim bregastim osovinama. Na Peugeot 308 modelima iz 2023–2024 godine, lanac od **8 mm** već dolazi sa fabrike.

Dakle, na velikom servisu treba obratiti pažnju ne samo na lanac razvodnog mehanizma, već i na lanac bregaste osovine, kao i na poznate karakteristike konkretnog motora.

src/content/works/peugeot-308-sw/index.m.a0329dfa24cc941c:
A 2024 Peugeot 308 with a **1.5 BlueHDi** diesel engine came into our car service in Belgrade for a major service. We completed a comprehensive range of work:

- Timing belt replacement;
- Water pump replacement;
- Coolant replacement;
- Engine oil change;
- Filter replacement;
- Inspection and servicing of all related components.

There is an important detail to know about the **1.5 BlueHDi** engine: the timing chain for the camshaft drive. Earlier versions of the engine were equipped with a **7 mm** wide chain. Over time, this chain can stretch, and in the worst-case scenario, it can break and damage the engine.

When servicing these engines, it’s recommended to install a reinforced **8 mm** chain, along with new camshaft beds and the camshafts themselves. For the 2023–2024 Peugeot 308 models, the **8 mm** chain is already installed from the factory.

Thus, during a major service, it’s crucial to check not only the timing belt but also the camshaft chain and be aware of the specific characteristics of the engine in question.

src/content/works/seat-leon/index.md.36e13b850e211957:
Seat Leon sa pređenih **190 000 km** dovezen je u naš ruski auto-servis u Beogradu na veliko planirano servisiranje, poznato i kao veliko servisiranje.

Na ovoj kilometraži, osnovne komponente je najbolje servisirati odmah, pa smo uradili:

- zamenu kompleta remena GRM;
- zamenu vodene pumpe;
- zamenu antifriza;
- zamenu motornog ulja;
- zamenu svih potrebnih filtera;
- zamenu zadnjih amortizera;
- zamenu ulja u DSG DQ250 menjaču.

Za Seat, Volkswagen, Škoda i Audi, veliko servisiranje je ključna tačka održavanja. Remen GRM, pumpa, tehničke tečnosti i potrošni materijal, kada se menjaju na vreme, sprečavaju mnogo skuplje neprijatnosti kasnije.

Posebno o **DQ250**. Ovo je šestostepeni robot sa mokrim kuplungom, a transmisijsko ulje u njemu treba menjati prema propisima — na tome menjač opstaje.

src/content/works/seat-leon/index.md.e9c99d35684a15cd:
A **190,000 km** SEAT LEON arrived at our Russian car service in Belgrade for a comprehensive scheduled maintenance, also known as a major service.

At this mileage, it's best to take care of the main components right away, so we performed the following:

- Replaced the timing belt kit;
- Replaced the water pump;
- Replaced the coolant;
- Changed the engine oil;
- Replaced all necessary filters;
- Changed the rear shock absorbers;
- Replaced the oil in the DSG DQ250 transmission.

For Seat, Volkswagen, Škoda, and Audi, a major service is a key maintenance point. Timely replacement of the timing belt, pump, technical fluids, and consumables helps avoid much more expensive issues down the line.

Regarding the **DQ250**: This is a six-speed dual-clutch transmission with wet clutches, and the transmission oil must be changed according to the recommended schedule — that’s what keeps the gearbox functioning properly.
